00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.092
- [Interviewer] Where
are you from originally?

00:00:15.092 --> 00:00:18.230
- [Neahbbahh] Originally,
Boston, Massachusetts.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.800
- [Interviewer] Boston. And,
you grew up with both parents?

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.070
One parent?

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:24.910
- [Neahbbahh] I grew up with
my mom and my stepfather.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.923
- [Interviewer] And
how was your childhood?

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.210
