there's a certain noise.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:07.410
I was diagnosed with severe PTSD

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.973
and bipolar schizoaffective,

00:04:12.266 --> 00:04:13.916
but that was all after the abuse.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.190
Yeah, and then I used for...

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.773
27, so I was 35, I believe?

00:04:29.275 --> 00:04:31.023
And then I stopped for a while.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.260
Then I met my husband,

00:04:34.582 --> 00:04:35.810
