00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:40.101
my whole world crashed.

00:04:40.101 --> 00:04:42.750
I lost everything. I lost my children.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.730
I lost...

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:50.633
I lost all sense of stability, I lost.

00:04:52.521 --> 00:04:54.180
When we got together, him and I.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.023
